  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sea Turtle Technical Assistance in the Gulf of Guinea, West Africa (2017-2020).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will provide technical support to MTCA funded projects in Equatorial Guinea, Gabon, Republic of Congo, Ivory Coast, Sao Tome and Principe, as well as conduct conservation programs and research in Corisco Bay as described in the proposal and conduct hawksbill, green and olive ridely genetics research focused on the Gulf of Guinea</narrative>
  </description>
